<body class="test-index">

<h2>test-{{test_id}} : {{description}}</h2>
<h5>Platform: \{{platform}}</h5>
<h5>Factorio Version \{{factorio_version}}</h5>


<h3 id="The-TLDR"> The TLDR </h3>
<p>
    A short summary of the data collected in the test that answers the question posed by the test
</p>

<h3 id="The-Question"> The Question </h3>
<p>
    A more detailed explanation of the question. Methodology and speculation about how to test the question. Potentially related
    questions that are not the specific topic of this test. Possible answers to the question, staged for testing.
</p>

<h3 id="The-Test"> The Test </h3>
<p>
    Test was performed by benchmarking the saves using the inbuilt Factorio benchmark. Each save was tested \{{runs}} times for \{{ticks}} ticks a piece
</p>
<p>
    Important information about the test. What attributes does the test have? How is the test being conducted?
</p>

<h3 id="The-Data"> The Data </h3>

<p>
    <img src="images/result_0_chart.svg"/>
    <img src="images/result_1_chart.svg"/>
    <img src="images/result_2_chart.svg"/>
</p>
<p>
<table>
    <thead>
    <tr>
        <th>Metric</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Mean UPS</strong></td>
        <td>Updates per second - higher is better</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Mean Avg (ms)</strong></td>
        <td>Average frame time - lower is better</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Mean Min (ms)</strong></td>
        <td>Minimum frame time - lower is better</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><strong>Mean Max (ms)</strong></td>
        <td>Maximum frame time - lower is better</td>
    </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<p>
<table>
    <thead>
    <tr>
        <th>Save</th>
        <th>Avg (ms)</th>
        <th>Min (ms)</th>
        <th>Max (ms)</th>
        <th>UPS</th>
        <th>Execution Time (ms)</th>
        <th>% Difference from base</th>
    </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    \{{#each results}}
        <tr>
            <td>\{{save_name}}</td>
            <td>\{{avg_ms}}</td>
            <td>\{{min_ms}}</td>
            <td>\{{max_ms}}</td>
            <td>\{{{avg_effective_ups}}}</td>
            <td>\{{total_execution_time_ms}}</td>
            <td>\{{percentage_improvement}}</td>
        </tr>
    \{{/each}}

    </tbody>
</table>
<p>
    All maps will be uploaded <a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=1rZo0oa4lQGdYYXyEbUnS0Cd8MD8DPpxf"> here.</a>
</p>


<h3 id="Closing"> Closing </h3>
<p>
    Closing notes about this test and other tests which may test a similar attribute or property
</p>
</body>
<footer>
    <div style="font-size:.9em"> Written by mulark on \{{date}}</div>
